<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Nestle shares.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Nestle shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Zurich said it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2000 CHF		  PREMIUM	13.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.75 CHF		  GEARING	21.07 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	21.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	23.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1845 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
